before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
int main(int argc, char *argv[]) {
    if (argc != 2) { puts("usage: app TOPIC"); return 1; }
    printf("topic=%s\n", argv[1]);
    return 0;
}
```

